ocking",[472,724,725,726,730],{},"The signature's default clock tolerance is 300 seconds; secret sequences support\nrotation. Deduplicate the ",[727,728,729],"strong",{},"signed"," ID, not an unsigned event-ID header. Scope all\nclaims by tenant\u002Fstorefront\u002Fmode. Unknown signed events remain retained\u002Fdispatched.",[655,732,734],{"id":733},"know-what-the-built-in-reactions-do","Know what the built-in reactions do",[660,736,737,747],{},[663,738,739],{},[666,740,741,744],{},[669,742,743],{},"Event",[669,745,746],{},"Local effect",[676,748,749,762,770,787,797,805,815],{},[666,750,751,756],{},[681,752,753],{},[476,754,755],{},"subscription.started",[681,757,758,759],{},"Upsert; first save emits ",[476,760,761],{},"local.subscription_created",[666,763,764,767],{},[681,765,766],{},"Subscription update\u002Fbilling\u002Fresume\u002Fcancel events",[681,768,769],{},"Update an existing snapshot and lifecycle expiry",[666,771,772,781],{},[681,773,774,777,778],{},[476,775,776],{},"order.paid",", ",[476,779,780],{},"order.payment_failed",[681,782,783,784],{},"Upsert order snapshot; first paid save emits ",[476,785,786],{},"local.order_created",[666,788,789,794],{},[681,790,791],{},[476,792,793],{},"order.canceled",[681,795,796],{},"Update an existing order",[666,798,799,802],{},[681,800,801],{},"Refund\u002Fchargeback events",[681,803,804],{},"Upsert optional reversal repositories",[666,806,807,812],{},[681,808,809],{},[476,810,811],{},"checkout.paid",[681,813,814],{},"Link through a host-owned checkout record",[666,816,817,820],{},[681,818,819],{},"Other\u002Funknown events",[681,821,822],{},"Dispatch without an invented resource write",[472,824,825,826,483],{},"Reactions make no implicit API reads. Customer bindings never determine ownership.\nCreated events can precede eventual ownership linkage; outbox consumers must read\ncurrent persisted ownership before acting. Dispatch external effects after commit\nwith idempotent consumer keys. Deduplication is not event o